    "missing_value_policy": "finite float32 or -999 sentinel; radial env imputes per-feature median for values <= -900, clips to [clip_min,clip_max], normalizes (x-mean)/scale, appends binary missing mask (135 -> 270 channels); radial/stats streams clip+normalize with no imputation and are zeroed where history_mask is false; motion model uses missing_threshold -900 with the same median-impute scheme. Never substitute zero winds.",
